  "title": "How variant-specific shedding may be key for ctDNA test interpretation",
  "summary": "In a study led by University of Pennsylvania and the Parker Institute for Cancer Immunotherapy, Personalis is a co-author on a poster being presented at the American Society of Clinical Oncology (ASCO) Annual Meeting 2022, titled, “Circulating KRAS variant-specific shedding and association with survival in patients with metastatic pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (mPDAC) receiving chemoimmunotherapy.” The post How variant-specific shedding may be key for ctDNA test interpretation appeared first on Personalis .",
